 "description": "\n <p>【Interactive Cat Toy for Indoor Cat】Press the button and this Interactive Rolling Ball will start spinning, moving and shaking, attracting your cat to chase and catch it<br>【Smart Cat Ball Toy】The cat ball toy Built-in intelligent motion sensor and automatic obstacle avoidance system, when the ball encounters obstacles or narrow spots, it will reverse itself and move away<br>【Excellent Material】The shell of the rolling ball toy is made of environmentally friendly and high-impact ABS material, which is soft, skin-friendly,wear-resistant<br>【Wave-Textured Surface】The ball surface is made of silicone, allowing it to roll smoothly even on carpets. The special wave-like texture increases movement unpredictability, keeping cats engaged<br>【Easy to Clean】The toy has a smooth surface and is easy to clean. Just wipe with a damp cloth to keep the toy clean and sanitary, allowing your pet to play more confidently, suitable for dogs and cats of all sizes and ages<br>【Three Modes Smart Cat Toy Ball】Interactive Cat Ball Toy built-in fast mode, slow mode , interactive mode Three modes（Quickly switch modes by clicking the switch twice）<br>【Fast Charging】Fully charge in only 20 minutes, lasts for up to 6 hours of pure fun.<br></p>\n <p>Note: The toy ball is equipped with a wake-up function.</p> \n <p>Specification:<br>Name: Electric Cat Dog Ball Toy<br>Material: PC+Silicone<br>Power supply: 5V1A<br>Input interface: Type-c<br>Note: Long press to turn on or off<br>Package:<br>1* Electric Dog Ball Toy<br>1* Charging cable.</p> \n <p><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/6f69dd70-382c-4c1e-871b-d1fa47954d7b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/109e2f85-3667-44b5-8f8e-9a72a84761d3.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/9eb9b351-aad3-45e3-9b30-1e532fc08eb1.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/e8c2290f-082f-488c-bbbc-4bd45ccd2c99.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/899bb2ea-7ab8-4581-91bf-0ce20deb71af.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/58f8def2-7403-485b-86fc-5b77b7a70cd8.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/598ccd22-b552-4aa4-a4a2-7efdc078a644.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/28d56a49-204c-4aa4-b669-acf763e7b641.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/bb5e6974-a9f9-4e55-b1d8-621d8608062a.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></p>\n",
